<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Java Topics - Krish Tech</title>

    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        font-family: Inter, Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #0b1120;
        color: white;
      }

      a {
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .container {
        width: 90%;
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: auto;
      }

      nav {
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        background: rgba(11,17,32,0.9);
      }

      .nav-wrapper {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 24px 0;
      }

      .logo {
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .logo span {
        color: #60a5fa;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 80px 0 40px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 58px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .hero p {
        color: #94a3b8;
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.8;
        max-width: 700px;
      }

      .topics {
        padding: 30px 0 100px;
      }

      .topics-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px,1fr));
        gap: 25px;
      }

      .topic-card {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #111827, #0f172a);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        border-radius: 24px;
        padding: 30px;
        transition: 0.3s;
      }

      .topic-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-6px);
        border-color: rgba(96,165,250,0.35);
      }

      .topic-card h3 {
        font-size: 26px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }

      .topic-card p {
        color: #94a3b8;
        line-height: 1.8;
        margin-bottom: 25px;
      }

      .topic-card a {
        color: #60a5fa;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>

    <nav>
      <div class="container nav-wrapper">
        <div class="logo">
          Krish <span>Tech</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero">

      <div class="container">

        <h1>Java Topics</h1>

        <p>
          Structured Java tutorials with interview-focused explanations,
          real-world examples and production-level concepts.
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>

    <section class="topics">

      <div class="container">

        <div class="topics-grid">

          <div class="topic-card">

            <h3>Exception Handling</h3>

            <p>
              A complete 12-part series — from what an exception is to
              production patterns, custom exceptions, and interview prep.
            </p>

            <a href="/java/exception-handling-overview">
              View Series →
            </a>

          </div>

          <div class="topic-card">

            <h3>Collections Framework</h3>

            <p>
              Master ArrayList, HashMap, Set and interview-focused
              collections concepts.
            </p>

            <a href="#">
              Coming Soon →
            </a>

          </div>

          <div class="topic-card">

            <h3>Java Threads</h3>

            <p>
              Understand multithreading, synchronization and concurrent
              programming concepts clearly.
            </p>

            <a href="#">
              Coming Soon →
            </a>

          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>

  </body>
</html>